# ATMOS under SEED, against Kolmogorov and Noll, and carried consistently to the focal plane (PLAN_CONSOLIDATION
# 1.2 (p), RULED 2026-10-18).  The manual's Cassegrain (4 m, 51-px grid, dx 0.08 m), r0 0.25 m at 1e-6, tilt
# participation 1, the RAY grid at the entrance-pupil Obscuring (element 1); OPD 1 = the screen, OPD 4 = the exit-
# pupil Reference, SPOT 5 at the focal plane (EFL 22.4736 m, EFL_SYSPROP.jou).  Pre-fix (RFOURN declared
# COMPLEX*8 since 019a2981, so the transform ran over 2x its array) the screen was a checkerboard 70-160x
# Kolmogorov at one pixel, its amplitude 1e5x seed-dependent, ifx non-deterministic under a fixed seed, and
# the ray tilt 3x the gradient (the 3-row stencil over 2 dx).  The checks are cli_tests/tools/atmos_map_check.py:
# slope / noll / carry / tilt per seed, kolm over the three seeds; the values are identical on ifx and gfortran.
# COPY: $ROOT/docs/macos-manual/examples/Cassegrain.in
old $DECK
none
text
! rm -f $TMP/*.txt
seed
12345
atm
1
0.25
1e-6
1.0
ray
opd 1
opd 4
opd 5
spot 5
tout
/null
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.OPD1.txt $TMP/s12345_1.dat
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.OPD4.txt $TMP/s12345_4.dat
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.spot5.txt $TMP/s12345_sp.dat
! python3 $ROOT/cli_tests/tools/atmos_map_check.py --screen s12345_1.dat --ep s12345_4.dat --spot s12345_sp.dat --dx 0.08 --r0 0.25 --lam 1e-6 --efl 22.4736 --dir $TMP
! rm -f $TMP/*.txt
seed
4321
atm
1
0.25
1e-6
1.0
ray
opd 1
opd 4
opd 5
spot 5
tout
/null
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.OPD1.txt $TMP/s4321_1.dat
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.OPD4.txt $TMP/s4321_4.dat
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.spot5.txt $TMP/s4321_sp.dat
! python3 $ROOT/cli_tests/tools/atmos_map_check.py --screen s4321_1.dat --ep s4321_4.dat --spot s4321_sp.dat --dx 0.08 --r0 0.25 --lam 1e-6 --efl 22.4736 --dir $TMP
! rm -f $TMP/*.txt
seed
777
atm
1
0.25
1e-6
1.0
ray
opd 1
opd 4
opd 5
spot 5
tout
/null
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.OPD1.txt $TMP/s777_1.dat
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.OPD4.txt $TMP/s777_4.dat
! mv $TMP/Cassegrain.in.spot5.txt $TMP/s777_sp.dat
! python3 $ROOT/cli_tests/tools/atmos_map_check.py --screen s777_1.dat --ep s777_4.dat --spot s777_sp.dat --dx 0.08 --r0 0.25 --lam 1e-6 --efl 22.4736 --dir $TMP
! python3 $ROOT/cli_tests/tools/atmos_map_check.py --screens s12345_1.dat,s4321_1.dat,s777_1.dat --dx 0.08 --r0 0.25 --lam 1e-6 --dir $TMP
! rm -f $TMP/*.txt
seed
12345
atm
1
0.25
